.THS News_in 8L News.SH NAME$N - gateways incoming mails to news..SH SYNOPSIS$N [-f=<sender>] <newsgroup>.SH DESCRIPTIONIn combination with.B News_out$N can be used to forward news as mails and to allow answering to anarticle via mail. For this you need a flexible mail transport agent,e.g. sendmail or MMail. The.B <sender>is optional and currently not used..B <newsgroup>must be a valid newsgroup either with dots or with hyphens. Validnewsgroups are then (e.g.) comp-lang-c or rec.games.frp. The hyphensolution is used to avoid a miss-parsing the dots as domains..SH CAVEATSThis is only a very primitiv solution and may cause several problems.